      "originalText": "Conditional source/model proof for actual lines 158–160. Ordinary descriptor/prototype paths and string captures only.\nCustom setter execution, the full Object.hasOwn realm and native adequacy remain open.\nMatcher.exec, containing if(m), params construction/spread and full search reachability remain open.\nProperty fuel is explicit; later handler output is a different object, outside this local theorem.",
